        "liquid_U7PKbq": {
          "type": "liquid",
          "settings": {
            "code": "<h3>TEACHERS: GET 12 HOURS OF CONTINUING EDUCATION\n</h3><p>Yoga Alliance requires all yoga teachers to accumulate at least 30 hours of continuing education every three years. 20 online hours are allowed to count toward this requirement.</p>\n<p>\n\nFulfilling 12 of these study hours is as easy as logging into the Yoga Alliance website and entering your hours after you've completed Yoga <i>History and Philosophy</i>. Continue your yoga education with this course and more from the Yoga International library!</p>",
