        "liquid_3axGWg": {
          "type": "liquid",
          "settings": {
            "code": "<h3>Doug Keller\n</h3><p>Doug Keller has been teaching full time in classes, workshops, and trainings for 23 years worldwide, after 14 years of study and practice, and after completing a Master's degree in philosophy and teaching at a college level at Fordham University. His yoga journey includes practicing in Siddha Yoga ashrams, intensive training in the Iyengar and Anusara methods, and nearly a decade of teaching in the U.S. and abroad. His book <i>Refining the Breath</i> has been around for 20 years, presented as a simple and accessible entry into the practice of pranayama. Asana instruction, essays, and other enlightening information are available on his website.</p>",
            "width": "66%",
            "alignment": "center"
          }
        }
